name: closeup venitian mask woman
---
A sultry, enigmatic woman wearing an elaborate black lace Venetian masquerade mask that covers her eyes. Intense, dramatic chiaroscuro lighting, reminiscent of Baroque portraiture, sculpting her features with deep shadows and brilliant highlights on her perfectly contoured skin. Her hair is dark and dramatically coiffed. High fashion editorial photography, cinematic, hyper-detailed, ultra-realistic, moody, rich textures, deep blacks and crimson tones, shot on Hasselblad, 85mm lens, volumetric light, Greg Rutkowski, Helmut Newton, Renaissance master painting influence, octane render, award-winning.